        "title": "Trying it out!",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<li>Drag the Dataflow program below and connect your EMG reader to your computer.</li><li></li><li>Then, connect your electrodes to the muscles you said (one option at a time). Graph what happens when you flex or relax that muscle.</li><li>Is it similar for both partners, or different?</li><li>What else do you notice?</li><li></li><li>Make sure to label your graphs!</li>"
